The complexity of a simulation model has nothing to do with the event queue. The event queue is a working abstraction totally transparent for and independent of the system you are modelling. The complexity of a model emerges from the number of steps that the underlying algorithm requires. If you ignore user-embedded functions, then the complexity is related to the trajectory, to the number of activities.

